摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"English · 简体中文","id":"gh:1337522147","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-chat","slug":"baixianger/dsh-chat","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"# DSH Chat"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-chat) [](LICENSE) [](https://github.com/topics/dsh-plugin)"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Bring people and DSH agents into shared rooms. Keep a readable timeline, select the agents you want "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"to reach, and add trusted remote hosts when you need them."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## A room with clear delivery"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| In the room | What happens |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Send a normal message | It appears in the shared timeline. |\n| Select an agent in the mention pick"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"er | Only the selected agent receives the message. |\n| Select `@all` | All eligible room agents rece"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ive it. |\n| Add a remote member | The room uses an explicitly paired Weave host. |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Typing an email address or a literal `@alias` does not wake an agent. Delivery uses the separate, st"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ructured mention selection."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"1. Ask an agent to create a chat room, for example: “Create a group chat called Release.”\n2. Open th"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"e room in the **Chatrooms** workspace.\n3. Use the member drawer to choose a **Host → Workspace → Ses"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"sion**.\n4. Write a message and select mentions when an agent should receive it."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"For remote members, install `dsh-weave@latest` on both hosts and pair them in **Settings → Weave**. "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"Local rooms work without Weave."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Designed for everyday conversations"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- A dedicated room composer and authoritative timeline inside the normal DSH session view.\n- Human-r"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"eadable aliases, avatars, timestamps, and explicit membership controls.\n- English/Chinese labels, ho"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"st theme colors, and a keyboard-friendly member drawer.\n- Durable room sessions and membership that "},{"id":"p14s4","text":"remain visible after a restart.\n- A bounded read-only cache for linked rooms when their host is unav"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"isible after a restart.\n- A bounded read-only cache for linked rooms when their host is unavailable."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Agent tools"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| `chat_create` | Create a named room. |\n| `chat_join` | Join a room. |\n| `chat_invite` | Invite a s"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ession to the room. |\n| `chat_send` | Send a room message with explicit mentions. |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"An agent's ordinary reply remains in its own session. To answer the room, it uses `chat_send`; the d"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"elivered message includes that guidance."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## How the pieces fit"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Each room has one authoritative host. That host owns membership and messages; linked hosts retain a "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"capability, cursor, and bounded cache. Archived members remain visible for removal but do not receiv"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"r, and bounded cache. Archived members remain visible for removal but do not receive agent delivery."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Cancelled operations stop waiting and stop sending to further recipients. Already committed room sta"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"te and delivered messages remain. User-cancelled remote sends are removed from the retry queue; inte"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"rrupted network delivery can otherwise be retained for up to seven days."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Field | Default |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `path` | `$DSH_HOME/dsh-chat/rooms.json` |\n| `workspacePath` | `$DSH_HOME/dsh-chat/Chatrooms` |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"`DSH_HOME` defaults to `~/.dsh`. Room state uses owner-only file permissions. The host must provide "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"the session-persistence service to create visible room sessions."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Current scope"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Rooms and explicit delivery are available today. Rich task handoff, remote approval/result cards, an"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"d session export/replay remain future work. Bridge owns local delivery; Weave owns cross-host transp"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ssion export/replay remain future work. Bridge owns local delivery; Weave owns cross-host transport."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Development & feedback"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Report an issue · Release notes · MIT license"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
